---
// FAQ Accordion Component — Practical Buyer Questions
---

<section id="faqs" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12] mb-4">
        <span>Frequently Asked Questions</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#100F12] tracking-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans'] leading-[1.12]">
        Everything you need to know
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed">
        Have questions about setup, WhatsApp migration, or team access? We have answers.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Accordion List -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <details class="faq-item group bg-[#FAF9FF] border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-6 open:shadow-sm transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-[#100F12] cursor-pointer select-none list-none">
          <span>Can we use our existing WhatsApp Business phone numbers?</span>
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-sm font-bold shrink-0">
            ↓
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/60">
          Yes! NewRelay integrates directly with the official Meta WhatsApp Cloud API. You can seamlessly migrate your existing landline or mobile number without losing your account history, or provision new numbers through our dashboard in seconds.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <details class="faq-item group bg-[#FAF9FF] border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-6 open:shadow-sm transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-[#100F12] cursor-pointer select-none list-none">
          <span>How many team members can use the same WhatsApp number?</span>
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-sm font-bold shrink-0">
            ↓
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/60">
          As many as your plan allows (from 3 to unlimited agents). Unlike the standard WhatsApp Business app which limits multi-device logins, NewRelay provides a true enterprise shared inbox with real-time collision detection so two teammates never double-reply.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details class="faq-item group bg-[#FAF9FF] border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-6 open:shadow-sm transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-[#100F12] cursor-pointer select-none list-none">
          <span>How does automated Google Review collection work?</span>
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-sm font-bold shrink-0">
            ↓
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/60">
          You can set automated triggers based on positive events — such as an order delivery, a resolved support ticket, or a high CSAT rating. NewRelay automatically sends a friendly SMS or WhatsApp message with a 1-tap link to your Google Business Profile or Trustpilot page.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <details class="faq-item group bg-[#FAF9FF] border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-6 open:shadow-sm transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-[#100F12] cursor-pointer select-none list-none">
          <span>Do I need technical skills or developers to install NewRelay?</span>
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-sm font-bold shrink-0">
            ↓
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/60">
          Zero coding is required. Our guided onboarding wizard helps you connect WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook Messenger, and your website widget in under 5 minutes.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <details class="faq-item group bg-[#FAF9FF] border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-6 open:shadow-sm transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-[#100F12] cursor-pointer select-none list-none">
          <span>What happens after the 14-day free trial?</span>
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-sm font-bold shrink-0">
            ↓
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/60">
          You get unrestricted access to all features during your 14-day trial without providing a credit card. At the end of the trial, you can choose the subscription tier that best fits your business or export your data anytime.
        </p>
      </details>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>
